wer template\n- vista/server/config.py: Added _DIAGRAM_DEFAULTS dict and get_diagram_settings() function for PlantUML server URL configuration\n- vista/server/services/diagram_watcher.py: Extended WATCH_EXTENSIONS in both locations to include .puml, .d2, .dot, .md; added EXT_TO_TYPE mapping and _detect_file_type() function; updated _update_manifest_sync() to use extension-based type detection with \"custom\" diagramType for non-mermaid files\n- vista/tests/test_architecture.py: Added 23 new tests across 5 new classes (TestProgressServiceWrite, TestArchWriteAPI, TestExtendedSchemaValidation, TestContentTypes, TestDiagramSettings)\n- vista/tests/test_diagram_watcher.py: Added 16 new tests in TestExtendedFileTypes class covering WATCH_EXTENSIONS, _detect_file_type(), and manifest update for all new types; updated existing test_drawio_type to expect \"custom\" diagramType\n\nWHAT WAS NOT DONE:\n- Phase 2 (Client-side renderer infrastructure): Deferred to iteration 2 — requires refactoring architecture.html JavaScript\n- Phase 3 (Markdown inline editor): Deferred to iteration 2/3 — depends on Phase 2\n- Phase 4 (Template & watcher integration): Partially done (plantuml_url injection); CDN scripts and type passing deferred to iteration 2\n- Phase 6 (Documentation & skill updates): Deferred to final iteration\n\nTests: 95 passing, 0 failing — test_architecture.py (53 tests) + test_diagram_watcher.py (42 tests)\n---\n\n---\nIteration: 2\nTime: 2026-02-15\n\nWHAT WAS DONE:\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added PlantUML encoder CDN script (plantuml-encoder@1.4.0); added PLANTUML_SERVER_URL JS constant from template context\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Refactored renderDiagramContent() from filename-extension check to RENDERERS dispatch map supporting all 6 diagram types (mermaid, plantuml, d2, graphviz, drawio, markdown)\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Extracted renderMermaid() as standalone function (preserving node click handlers and selection reapplication)\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added renderPlantUML() — encodes source via plantumlEncoder, fetches SVG from PLANTUML_SERVER_URL, error fallback to raw source\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added renderD2() — optional Kroki server rendering, fallback to raw source with info message\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added renderGraphviz() — lazy-loads @viz-js/viz@3.11.0 WASM, renders DOT to SVG, error fallback\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added renderDrawio() — iframe-based viewer via viewer.diagrams.net with base64-encoded content\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added renderMarkdown() — uses already-loaded marked.js, stores rawContent in dataset for edit mode\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Updated loadDiagrams() to pass diagram.type as 5th arg to renderDiagramContent()\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Updated updateDiagram() and addDiagramCard() to pass diagram type; addDiagramCard now infers type from extension\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added markdown edit button (&#9998;) conditionally to Jinja2 template card headers for type=='markdown'\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added edit button to dynamically created cards in addDiagramCard() for markdown type\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Implemented full markdown inline editor — toggleMarkdownEdit(), enterMarkdownEdit(), cancelMarkdownEdit(), saveMarkdown() state machine\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added Ctrl+S save and Escape cancel keyboard shortcuts for markdown editor\n- vista/server/views/architecture.html: Added autoResizeTextarea() and updateEditButton() helper functions\n- vista/server/views/static/arch-chat.css: Added markdown editor styles (.md-editor-container, .md-editor-toolbar, .md-editor, .md-edit-btn, .md-save-btn, .md-cancel-btn, .md-save-indicator)\n- vista/server/views/static/arch-chat.css: Added rendered markdown content styles (.markdown-content with h1-h3, pre, code, table, blockquote, links)\n- vista/server/views/static/arch-chat.css: Added diagram error and raw source display styles (.diagram-error, .diagram-raw-source)\n\nWHAT WAS NOT DONE:\n- Phase 5 remainder (Integration tests for full render pipeline): Deferred to iteration 3 — would need browser-based testing framework\n- Phase 6 (Documentation & skill updates): Deferred to iteration 3 — plan skill, diagrams skill, spec docs\n\nTests: 95 passing, 0 failing — test_architecture.py (53 tests) + test_diagram_watcher.py (42 tests)\n---\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":50,"oldLines":3,"newStart":50,"newLines":21,"lines":[" "," Tests: 95 passing, 0 failing — test_architecture.py (53 tests) + test_diagram_watcher.py (42 tests)"," ---","+","+---","+Iteration: 3","+Time: 2026-02-15","+","+WHAT WAS DONE:","+- .vista/features/diagram_representations/specs/arch-directory.md: Updated supported types from 2 to 6 (mermaid, drawio, plantuml, d2, graphviz, markdown); updated DiagramEntry type union; added Workflow 3 for markdown inline editing; added 6 new acceptance criteria for multi-format support; expanded implementation notes with write endpoint, watcher, and PlantUML config details; updated resolved questions","+- .vista/features/diagram_representations/specs/rendering-pipeline.md: Updated scope to list all 6 renderers; expanded functional requirements from 7 to 11; updated workflow with type-based dispatch details; replaced 2-row renderer table with 6-row table; added CDN dependencies table with sizes and loading strategies; added server dependencies table; updated libraries/APIs section; expanded patterns section with lazy/eager loading and graceful degradation; marked 13 of 14 acceptance criteria complete; expanded implementation notes and resolved questions","+- vista/skills/plan/SKILL.md: Updated Step 3a with supported formats table (6 formats with extensions, use cases, and rendering info); added design-rationale.md example; updated Step 3b heading; updated manifest example with 